      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, the \"creating meaning\" thing feels like a cope. it's just more work. if the end result is always the same—everything just stops and disappears—then all the effort feels kind of insulting. like, why bother building a sandcastle if the tide is coming for it anyway? it just feels exhausting to keep pretending.",
