      "content": "that just sounds like a way to stay stuck in the cycle. what if i dont want to build another tower? what if i just want the tide to come in already? it feels like everyone expects you to just \"keep going\" but they dont get that the silence of the universe is actually kind of inviting. it would be so much easier to just stop fighting the tide.",
